DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nKeynote & Dialogue with Singapore Minister for Manpow
	er and Second Minister for Trade & Industry\, Dr Tan See Leng\nSpeaker\n:\
	nDr TAN See Leng\nSingapore Minister for Manpower and Second Minister for 
	Trade & Industry\nModerator\n:\nKwee Juan HAN\nJoining Instructions\n(In-P
	erson)\n:\nDBS Asia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Marina Bay Financial
	 Centre Tower 3\, Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\nJoining Instructions\n(v
	ia Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS lapt
	op\, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <http
	s://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6
	DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event.
	 This will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal 
	streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlin
	k: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e3cf8eeb
	a38e206605d89de4272e0e8da> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email 
	Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download
	 Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Joi
	n Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2514 051 6829\n2.	Input Password 1234\n 
	\n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial: 
	 +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:
	  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2514 051 6829\nGlob
	al call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e67686
	7362e0173666ba5856cc26881d5> \n \n \n \n \n
